{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "sse-demo-api-001",
		"name": "SSE Demo API - Complete Collection",
		"description": "Collection completa para testar todos os endpoints da API SSE Demo.\n\n**Funcionalidades:**\n- CRUD completo de dados\n- Testes de internacionalização (I18N)\n- Endpoints SSE e notificações\n- Health checks e estatísticas\n- Testes automatizados com scripts\n\n**Como usar:**\n1. Importe o environment SSE-Demo-Environment\n2. Configure a variável `language` (pt, en, es, it)\n3. Execute os requests na ordem sugerida\n4. Use os testes automatizados para validação\n\n**Autor:** SSE Demo Team\n**Versão:** 1.0.0",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🏥 Health & Status",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Health Check",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has status UP\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql(\"UP\");",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has message\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.message).to.exist;",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has locale info\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.locale).to.exist;",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Set timestamp for dynamic testing",
									"pm.environment.set(\"timestamp\", new Date().toISOString());"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{fullApiUrl}}/health?lang={{language}}",
							"host": [
								"{{fullApiUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"health"
							],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "lang",
									"value": "{{language}}",
									"description": "Idioma da resposta"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Verifica a saúde da aplicação e testa I18N"
					}
				},
